      </div>
      <div class="float-chip chip-b">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 17l6-6-6-6M12 19h8"/></svg>
        Shared on GitHub
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ===== About ===== -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="about-text">
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom:0">
        <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
        <h2>Who am I</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lead">I'm an <b>AI newbie</b> and a <b>coding beginner</b> — still fumbling my way through, and loving every bit of it.</p>
      <p class="body">GitHub can feel overwhelming when you're starting out. So my mission is simple: dig through the open-source world, find the genuinely useful projects, and share them with clear, beginner-friendly notes — so others don't have to start from zero.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pnum">D</span>
        <div><h4>Discover</h4><p>Hunt for interesting, practical and well-kept open-source projects across AI, tools and more.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pnum">S</span>
        <div><h4>Share</h4><p>Post finds with honest, plain explanations — what it does, why it's worth a look.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <span class="pnum">L</span>
        <div><h4>Learn</h4><p>Explore by doing. Every repo I try teaches me a little more about programming and AI.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== What I share ===== -->
<section id="share">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">What I share</div>
      <h2>Kinds of gems I collect</h2>
      <p>Everything I post falls into a few friendly categories — useful stuff, not noise.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cats">
      <div class="cat">
        <div class="tile tile-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9z"/><path d="M12 12l8-4.5M12 12L4 7.5M12 12v9"/></svg></div>
        <h3>AI tools &amp; demos</h3>
        <p>Handy AI libraries, apps and playgrounds worth trying — explained simply.</p>
        <span class="tag">LLMs · Agents · Image</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cat">
        <div class="tile tile-2"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L4 17v3h3l5.3-5.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.4 2.4-2.6-.6-.6-2.6z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Dev utilities</h3>
        <p>Small tools that make daily coding and tinkering a lot smoother.</p>
        <span class="tag">CLI · Productivity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cat">
        <div class="tile tile-3"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h10"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Awesome lists</h3>
        <p>Curated collections of the best resources on a topic — perfect for beginners.</p>
        <span class="tag">Curated resources</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cat">
        <div class="tile tile-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 10v6M2 10l10-5 10 5-10 5z"/><path d="M6 12v5c3 3 9 3 12 0v-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Learning resources</h3>
        <p>Great tutorials, courses and docs that make AI and coding click.</p>
        <span class="tag">Tutorials · Docs</span>
